        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, liquefied, production DZ, at freight ship</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, liquefied, production DZ, at freight ship
The process is normalized on the gaseous form of gas. The net calorific value of natural gas is 36.0 MJ/Nm³. UUID=4c1fd11b-6069-38b3-b092-6c1e8fd1f8fb
This dataset describes the transport of natural gas on a freight ship between the liquefaction plant in DZ and a Global evaporation plant.
Location: not known
Technology: The distances between liquefaction and evaporation plant is based on port distances.
Time period: Transport modes investigated for 2023.
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4c1fd11b-6069-38b3-b092-6c1e8fd1f8fb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
